  "description": "BLAKE3 cryptographic hash function for .NET in pure managed C# — no native libraries, no P/Invoke. SIMD accelerated (AVX2, SSE/SSSE3, ARM NEON) with multithreaded hashing of large inputs. Supports keyed hashing (MAC), key derivation (KDF) and extendable output (XOF), plus a HashAlgorithm adapter and a hashing Stream wrapper. A fully managed, AOT-friendly alternative to native BLAKE3 wrappers — ideal for checksums, content addressing, deduplication and file integrity. Runs everywhere .NET runs, with automatic scalar fallback.",
